{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01319uzD5eq45pp85z6qxZbn","type":"tool_result","content":"engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs:224:                    p.add(Shape::closed_line(pts, Stroke::new(sp.s(7.0), c(TEAL))));\n# Issues found by testing (running count)\n- Browser: all sets drew at once; 0.4 fps in software (performance, not game-breaking). Fixed with a stage box.\n- Browser: taps shorter than a frame were lost on menu keys (would have been a real bug at low frame rates).\n- Browser: a touch's click was lost because the pointer goes in the same frame (touch-only Settings unreachable: critical for that device).\n- Hover needed a moving pointer on its first move.\n- Core: 13 props failed to load (wrong category/keys), so gulls were magenta markers. Found by screenshot, then locked by a test.\n- Core: Paddle bot under 2 stars; Step Party careless play scored 400 (spam); both tuned.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"b876e008-f159-4a1f-af93-d50f5bfbf04c","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:06:40.415Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"engine/crates/pav_ui/src/fit_ui.rs:224:                    p.add(Shape::closed_line(pts, Stroke::new(sp.s(7.0), c(TEAL))));\n# Issues found by testing (running count)\n- Browser: all sets drew at once; 0.4 fps in software (performance, not game-breaking). Fixed with a stage box.\n- Browser: taps shorter than a frame were lost on menu keys (would have been a real bug at low frame rates).\n- Browser: a touch's click was lost because the pointer goes in the same frame (touch-only Settings unreachable: critical for that device).\n- Hover needed a moving pointer on its first move.\n- Core: 13 props failed to load (wrong category/keys), so gulls were magenta markers. Found by screenshot, then locked by a test.\n- Core: Paddle bot under 2 stars; Step Party careless play scored 400 (spam); both tuned.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":fal