{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjQVnApiQGfjYrmcsr4J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Gex1f7xNitPsEAWc7qwVib","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-223953__x35112d/work/WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953\npython3 - <<'PY'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read()\n    assert old in s, (path, old[:60])\n    open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nF='engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/'\nsub(F+'script.toml','''  \"Breathe in. Breathe out. You are doing it. Some guests need reminding.\"\n''','''  \"Breathe in. Breathe out. You are doing it. Some guests need reminding.\",\n  \"Did you know? Nine out of ten cushions recommend standing. The tenth has been spoken to.\",\n  \"Your shadow has better posture than you do. I have told it not to gloat.\",\n  \"The brochure says five days. The brochure has been here longer than I have.\",\n  \"You smiled at 2:14 this afternoon. I have made a note. Please do not let it happen by accident.\",\n  \"Did you know? The horizon is level. It is the only one of us who has managed it.\",\n  \"I am rated for 140 stands. You are my 139th. I am sure it is fine.\"\n''')\nsub('engine/crates/pav_core/tests/fit.rs','assert!(pip >= 40, \"Pip has {pip} lines\");','assert!(pip >= 80, \"Pip has {pip} lines\");')\nsub(F+'mod.rs','''        self.goto_set(sim, HUB, wake);\n        self.dress(sim);\n        self.set_mode(Mode::Island);\n        self.play_song(ev, 1);\n        let pick = sim.state.rng.next_u32();''','''        self.goto_set(sim, HUB, wake);\n        self.dress(sim);\n        self.set_mode(Mode::Island);\n        self.play_song(ev, 1);\n        // Up from the cabana with a stretch.\n        let stretch = crate::clips::find_cached(\"FIT/Wake\");\n        if let Some(ch) = sim.state.player.and_then(|p| sim.state.entities.get_mut(p)).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) {\n            ch.anim.replay_clip(stretch, crate::clips::ONCE, 1.0);\n        }\n        let pick = sim.state.rng.next_u32();''')\nsub(F+'mod.rs','''        let _ = sim;\n        let g = self.guest_mut();\n        g.stamps = (g.stamps + 1).min(5);\n        self.set_mode(Mode::Stamp);''','''        // Flat out on the cabana deck while the stamp lands.\n        let wake = self.spots.get(HUB, \"wake\");\n        self.goto_set(sim, HUB, wake);\n        let asleep = crate::clips::find_cached(\"FIT/Sleep\");\n        if let Some(ch) = sim.state.player.and_then(|p| sim.state.entities.get_mut(p)).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) {\n            ch.anim.play_clip(asleep, 0, 1.0);\n        }\n        let g = self.guest_mut();\n        g.stamps = (g.stamps + 1).min(5);\n        self.set_mode(Mode::Stamp);''')\nsub(F+'finale.rs','''        cx.ev.push(SimEvent::Music { song: 6 });\n        f.enter(cx);''','''        cx.ev.push(SimEvent::Music { song: 6 });\n        // The whole cast, on rafts, murmuring.\n        cx.sfx(sfx::MURMUR, 1.0, 1.0);\n        f.enter(cx);''')\nsub(F+'events/tray.rs','''            cx.sfx(sfx::GLASS, 0.9, 1.0);''','''            cx.sfx(sfx::GLASS, 0.9, 1.0);\n            cx.sfx(sfx::SPLASH_S, 0.7, 1.2);''')\nPY\ncat >> notes/feedback.md <<'E'\n- Audit against the plan, not a test: Pip was 2 lines short of 80 (my lint said 40), and the Sleep and Wake clips and two sounds were never used. Fixed; the lint now says 80.\nE\ntools/build.sh 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-40; tests/run.sh all > notes/final-tests.txt 2>&1; cut -c1-300 notes/final-tests.txt","description":"Close the content gaps, rebuild the final page, run the full suite","timeout":2400000,"run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2220,"cache_read_input_tokens":677768,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_token