{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRPvyLqqeGczAnwhefh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The final page now passes the full suite, **75 passed, 0 failed**, including the bot playthrough, browser checks and hub harness. That replaces the 74 passed, 1 failed I reported earlier.\n\n**What changed since that report:**\n- **Pip's lines:** the plan asks for at least 80 and Pip had 78, because my own check only required 40. I added 6 lines and raised the check to 80.\n- **Clips:** the Sleep and Wake clips existed but never played. You now stretch on waking and lie flat while the day's stamp lands.\n- **Sounds:** the crowd murmur now plays when the Big Stand starts, and the small splash plays when a glass goes overboard in Tray Trek.\n\nI audited content counts, clips and sounds against PLAN.md, not every line of it. The events, menus, attract mode, dev mode and hub are covered by the tests, but apart from Pip's lines that check doesn't cover the content the plan lists.\n\n**Still true:**\n- Nobody has played it, so feel and difficulty for a person are estimates.\n- A real controller, phone, TV and real GPU speed are untested here. Stand-ins were used for the first three.\n- The 1080p screenshot that took minutes was software rendering on this machine, not a measure of real hardware.\n- \"Usage: added on import\" is the exact wording TASK.md asks for; the importer fills in the real numbers later.\n\nThe Source Information and feedback in my previous message still stand, and the same text is in the game's About screen and `exit-interview.json`, which parses as valid JSON. I deleted `engine/target` again after the passing run.\n\nEverything is in `work/`:\n- `WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953.html` (open this to play)\n- `exit-interview.json`\n- `PROGRESS.md`\n- `WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953/` (source, tests, tools and notes)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1014,"cache_read_input_tokens":683178,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1014},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"d1e0f2f6-4eb2-4a6d-8430-dba454c59e5a","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:54:53.698Z","request_id":"req_011CgjRPvezikcJ3kpz4ZjB5"}
