{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRQt7yp3ojyAB2mGfcs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You're right that a partial audit isn't enough, so I'm going through PLAN.md and TASK.md section by section and writing the result to `notes/plan-audit.md`. Reading them against the code already turns up more gaps:\n\n- Single step in Dev Mode can't work from the pause menu.\n- The look screen has no turntable, and palms don't sway.\n- The pad-style low-pass LFO and the focus bounce are missing.\n- Step Party has 85 notes against the plan's roughly 100.\n- The intro can't be skipped.\n- Tests for device-following prompts, the Xbox option and rewind are missing.\n\nI'm fixing all of these."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1050,"cache_read_input_tokens":684192,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1050},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"83802dd4-d0e6-448f-b333-cb1a27303504","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:55:43.067Z","request_id":"req_011CgjRQsdTNpDdiw24nK6rM"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjRQt7yp3ojyAB2mGfcs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MLDsHcYjxKu58ykS7FwgsS","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-223953__x35112d/work/WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953\npython3 - <<'PY'\ndef sub(path, old, new):\n    s=open(path).read()\n    assert old in s, (path, old[:70])\n    open(path,'w').write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nF='engine/crates/pav_core/src/games/fit/'\nM=F+'mod.rs'\n# single step works from the pause menu; the flag lives through this tick's frozen() check\nsub(M,'''        self.tick += 1;\n        let dt = if dt <= 0.0 { 1.0 / 60.0 } else { dt };''','''        self.tick += 1;\n        self.dev.step = false;\n        let dt = if dt <= 0.0 { 1.0 / 60.0 } else { dt };''')\nsub(M,'''            if self.paused {\n                self.pause_t += dt;\n            } else if !self.dev_frozen() {\n                self.mode_tick(sim, &stream, dt, events);\n            }''','''            if self.paused && !self.dev.step {\n                self.pause_t += dt;\n            } else if !self.dev_frozen() {\n                self.mode_tick(sim, &stream, dt, events);\n            }''')\nsub(M,'''        self.dev.step = false;\n        self.update_cam(sim, input, dt);''','''        self.update_cam(sim, input, dt);\n        // A live figure on a turntable while choosing a look.\n        if self.menus.last().is_some_and(|m| matches!(m.kind, MenuKind::Look | MenuKind::Wardrobe)) {\n            let f = self.tick as f32 / 60.0 * 0.9;\n            if let Some(ch) = sim.state.player.and_then(|p| sim.state.entities.get_mut(p)).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) {\n                ch.facing = f;\n                ch.anim.facing = f;\n            }\n        }''')\nsub(M,'''    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        self.paused || self.dev_frozen()\n    }''','''    fn frozen(&self) -> bool {\n        (self.paused || self.dev_frozen()) && !self.dev.step\n    }''')\nsub(M,'''    pub turntable: bool,\n''','')\nsub(M,'''        turntable: false,\n''','')\n# back skips dialogue\nsub(M,'''                let conf = input.just(btn::CONFIRM) || input.just(btn::PRIMARY);\n                let speed = self.save.settings.text_speed;\n                let skip = self.dev.skip_dialog;''','''                let conf = input.just(btn::CONFIRM) || input.just(btn::PRIMARY);\n                let speed = self.save.settings.text_speed;\n                // Back skips the rest of what is being said.\n                let skip = self.dev.skip_dialog || input.just(btn::BACK);''')\nsub(F+'dialog.rs','''        if self.finished_line() {\n            b.prompt_right(1640.0, 978.0, &[Glyph::Confirm], \"\");\n        }''','''        b.prompt(300.0, 978.0, &[Glyph::Back], \"Skip\");\n        if self.finished_line() {\n            b.prompt_right(1640.0, 978.0, &[Glyph::Confirm], \"\");\n        }''')\n# victory on a three-star result\nsub(M,'''                if stars == 3 {\n                    let at = sim.feet''','''                if stars == 3 {\n                    let id = crate::clips::find_cached(\"MESH2MOTION/Victory\");\n                    if let Some(ch) = sim.state.player.and_then(|p| sim.state.entities.get_mut(p)).and_then(|e| e.character.as_mut()) {\n                        ch.anim.tilt_side = 0.0;\n                        ch.anim.tilt_fwd = 0.0;\n                        ch.anim.play_clip(id, 0, 1.0);\n                    }\n                    let at = sim.feet''')\n# chart ~100 notes\np=F+'charts.toml'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s[:s.index('bars = [')]+'''bars = [\n \"L...R...\", \"L...R...\", \"L.R.L...\", \"R.L.R...\",\n \"L.R.L.R.\", \"L.R.L.R.\", \"L.R.L.R.\", \"L.R.B...\",\n \"L.R.L.R.\", \"R.L.R.L.\", \"L.R.L.R.\", \"R.L.B...\",\n \"R.L.R.L.\", \"R.L.R.L.\", \"L.RLR.L.\", \"L.R.B.B.\",\n \"L.R.L.R.\", \"LR.LR.L.\", \"L.R.B.B.\", \"L.RL.RL.\",\n \"B.L.R.L.