{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014ifKgfrMo4S5LYgHmwbPE6","type":"tool_result","content":"283\t## 9. Animation\n284\t\n285\t**Base:** the engine's puppet (procedural walk, idle, landing, squash and stretch) with motion clips on top.\n286\t\n287\t**Library clips to use:** `MESH2MOTION/Jog`, `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`, `MESH2MOTION/Jumping Jacks`, `CMU/Hop_One_Foot_Loop`, `STYLE100/Balance_Walk`, `CMU/Wave_Hello`, `CMU/Stretch_Yawn`, `MESH2MOTION/Cheering_Two_Hands`, `MESH2MOTION/Victory`, `MESH2MOTION/Sitting_Idle`, `QUATERNIUS/Dance_Loop`. Search with `clips find=word`. There are no yoga or hula clips.\n288\t\n289\t**Hand-keyed clips (verified feasible).** Write readable key poses into `engine/anim/fit.json`. Test without rebuilding: in `pav repl` run `anim_reload`, then `animsheet clip=FIT/Tree frames=1 size=300 out=out/tree.png`. The build embeds every `anim/*.json`. A tree pose, a warrior lunge and a squat were recognisable at the first attempt:\n290\t\n291\t```json\n292\t{\"set\":\"FIT\",\"title\":\"Tippy Cay moves\",\"format\":1,\"credit\":\"Hand-keyed for this game (CC0).\",\"legend\":[],\"fps\":30,\"sources\":{},\"clips\":{\n293\t\"Squat\":{\"clip\":\"Squat\",\"dur\":1.0,\"loop\":false,\"tags\":[\"exercise\"],\"desc\":\"Stand to deep squat; scrub clip time with depth.\",\"keys\":[\n294\t {\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,100],\"body\":[0,0,0],\"chest\":[0,0,0],\"head\":[0,0,0],\"armL\":[10,10,-95,10,0],\"armR\":[10,10,-95,10,0],\"legL\":[0,6,-100,0,0],\"legR\":[0,6,-100,0,0]},\n295\t {\"t\":1,\"hips\":[-22,0,58],\"body\":[0,28,0],\"chest\":[0,5,0],\"head\":[0,-22,0],\"armL\":[100,4,10,0,0],\"armR\":[100,4,10,0,0],\"legL\":[55,10,-60,95,0],\"legR\":[55,10,-60,95,0],\"footL\":[-12,0,0],\"footR\":[-12,0,0]}]},\n296\t\"Warrior\":{\"clip\":\"Warrior\",\"dur\":2.0,\"loop\":true,\"tags\":[\"pose\"],\"desc\":\"Deep lunge, arms out.\",\"keys\":[\n297\t {\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,72],\"body\":[35,0,0],\"chest\":[-35,-4,0],\"head\":[-30,0,0],\"armL\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"armR\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"legL\":[70,0,-55,95,0],\"legR\":[-85,20,-60,0,0],\"footR\":[10,40,0]},\n298\t {\"t\":2,\"hips\":[0,0,72],\"body\":[35,0,0],\"chest\":[-35,-4,0],\"head\":[-30,0,0],\"armL\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"armR\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"legL\":[70,0,-55,95,0],\"legR\":[-85,20,-60,0,0],\"footR\":[10,40,0]}]}\n299\t}}\n300\t```\n301\t\n302\tField meanings are in `LEGEND` at the top of `engine/crates/pav_core/src/clips.rs`: `hips [forward, right, up]` in percent of standing hip height; `body`, `chest` and `head [turn, lean, tilt]` in degrees; limbs `[forward, out, up, bend, twist]`. The plank attempt pointed its legs up, so start the plank from `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`'s key instead.\n303\t\n304\t**Make:** Breath, Squat, Tree (Heron), Warrior (Lunge), Lighthouse, DeckChair, Bridge, Seated, ArmFlail (upper body), Stumble, StepL, StepR, HipCircle, CarryTray, Tuck, DiveEntry, Flop, Bow, Sleep, Wake, Sigh. Check motion with `filmstrip` and `animsheet`.\n305\t\n306\t**Scrubbing a clip with gameplay** (depth, breath): call `anim.play_clip(id, 0, 1e-6)` and write `anim.clip_t` yourself each tick. A speed of 0 means normal speed, so use a tiny positive value (read in `PuppetState::update`).\n307\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"14caa6b2-1a0b-4959-8ce6-30a4306bd843","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:22:01.283Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-223953__x35112d/work/PLAN.md","content":"## 9. Animation\n\n**Base:** the engine's puppet (procedural walk, idle, landing, squash and stretch) with motion clips on top.\n\n**Library clips to use:** `MESH2MOTION/Jog`, `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`, `MESH2MOTION/Jumping Jacks`, `CMU/Hop_One_Foot_Loop`, `STYLE100/Balance_Walk`, `CMU/Wave_Hello`, `CMU/Stretch_Yawn`, `MESH2MOTION/Cheering_Two_Hands`, `MESH2MOTION/Victory`, `MESH2MOTION/Sitting_Idle`, `QUATERNIUS/Dance_Loop`. Search with `clips find=word`. There are no yoga or hula clips.\n\n**Hand-keyed clips (verified feasible).** Write readable key poses into `engine/anim/fit.json`. Test without rebuilding: in `pav repl` run `anim_reload`, then `animsheet clip=FIT/Tree frames=1 size=300 out=out/tree.png`. The build embeds every `anim/*.json`. A tree pose, a warrior lunge and a squat were recognisable at the first attempt:\n\n```json\n{\"set\":\"FIT\",\"title\":\"Tippy Cay moves\",\"format\":1,\"credit\":\"Hand-keyed for this game (CC0).\",\"legend\":[],\"fps\":30,\"sources\":{},\"clips\":{\n\"Squat\":{\"clip\":\"Squat\",\"dur\":1.0,\"loop\":false,\"tags\":[\"exercise\"],\"desc\":\"Stand to deep squat; scrub clip time with depth.\",\"keys\":[\n {\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,100],\"body\":[0,0,0],\"chest\":[0,0,0],\"head\":[0,0,0],\"armL\":[10,10,-95,10,0],\"armR\":[10,10,-95,10,0],\"legL\":[0,6,-100,0,0],\"legR\":[0,6,-100,0,0]},\n {\"t\":1,\"hips\":[-22,0,58],\"body\":[0,28,0],\"chest\":[0,5,0],\"head\":[0,-22,0],\"armL\":[100,4,10,0,0],\"armR\":[100,4,10,0,0],\"legL\":[55,10,-60,95,0],\"legR\":[55,10,-60,95,0],\"footL\":[-12,0,0],\"footR\":[-12,0,0]}]},\n\"Warrior\":{\"clip\":\"Warrior\",\"dur\":2.0,\"loop\":true,\"tags\":[\"pose\"],\"desc\":\"Deep lunge, arms out.\",\"keys\":[\n {\"t\":0,\"hips\":[0,0,72],\"body\":[35,0,0],\"chest\":[-35,-4,0],\"head\":[-30,0,0],\"armL\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"armR\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"legL\":[70,0,-55,95,0],\"legR\":[-85,20,-60,0,0],\"footR\":[10,40,0]},\n {\"t\":2,\"hips\":[0,0,72],\"body\":[35,0,0],\"chest\":[-35,-4,0],\"head\":[-30,0,0],\"armL\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"armR\":[0,100,0,0,0],\"legL\":[70,0,-55,95,0],\"legR\":[-85,20,-60,0,0],\"footR\":[10,40,0]}]}\n}}\n```\n\nField meanings are in `LEGEND` at the top of `engine/crates/pav_core/src/clips.rs`: `hips [forward, right, up]` in percent of standing hip height; `body`, `chest` and `head [turn, lean, tilt]` in degrees; limbs `[forward, out, up, bend, twist]`. The plank attempt pointed its legs up, so start the plank from `MESH2MOTION/Pushup`'s key instead.\n\n**Make:** Breath, Squat, Tree (Heron), Warrior (Lunge), Lighthouse, DeckChair, Bridge, Seated, ArmFlail (upper body), Stumble, StepL, StepR, HipCircle, CarryTray, Tuck, DiveEntry, Flop, Bow, Sleep, Wake, Sigh. Check motion with `filmstrip` and `animsheet`.\n\n**Scrubbing a clip with gameplay** (depth, breath): call `anim.play_clip(id, 0, 1e-6)` and write `anim.clip_t` yourself each tick. A speed of 0 means normal speed, so use a tiny positive value (read in `PuppetState::update`).\n","numLines":25,"startLine":283,"totalLines":633}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014ifKgfrMo4S5LYgHmwbPE6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjY2kdE4mLUxdBTwb6SU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VMzRJdW24vmBHCkr2LVZyZ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-223953__x35112d/work/WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953/engine\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo build --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80\nmkdir -p ../notes/sheets; cd ..\nW=1920 H=1080 tools/shots.sh hub:fit/free:5 studio:fit/event/pose:300 gazebo:fit/event/squats:300 boardwalk:fit/event/step:600 tide:fit/event/tide:400 channel:fit/event/paddle:500 pier:fit/event/tray:500 tower:fit/event/cannon:200 bay:fit/stand/1:300\ncd notes/cap && for s in hub studio gazebo boardwalk tide channel pier tower bay; do cp $s.png ../sheets/$s-1080p.png; done; cd ../..; rm -rf notes/cap\ncd notes/sheets; magick montage *-1080p.png -tile 3x3 -geometry 640x360+2+2 ../sets-sheet.png 2>/dev/null; cd ../../engine\nfor c in Tree Warrior Lighthouse DeckChair Bridge Seated Squat Tuck Flop Plank Paddle CarryTray; do printf 'animsheet clip=FIT/%s frames=2 size=260 out=../notes/sheets/clip-%s.png\\n' $c $c; done | ./target/debug/pav repl 2>&1 | grep -ci error\ncd ../notes/sheets; magick montage clip-*.png -tile 4x3 -geometry 460x+2+2 ../clips-sheet.png 2>/dev/null; rm -f clip-*.png; ls -la ..","description":"Make the 1080p sheet per set and a motion sheet of the hand-keyed clips","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":747271,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":944},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"b792f0b2-549d-45fc-a55e-f23215de7482","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:22:07.437Z","request_id":"req_011CgjY2kHPJnUQrShro8mHU","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VMzRJdW24vmBHCkr2LVZyZ":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build-v2__20261104-223953__x35112d/work/WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953/engine\nCARGO_BUILD_JOBS=8 cargo build --locked -p pav_tools --bin pav 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80\nmkdir -p ../notes/sheets; cd ..\nW=1920 H=1080 tools/shots.sh hub:fit/free:5 studio:fit/event/pose:300 gazebo:fit/event/squats:300 boardwalk:fit/event/step:600 tide:fit/event/tide:400 channel:fit/event/paddle:500 pier:fit/event/tray:500 tower:fit/event/cannon:200 bay:fit/stand/1:300\ncd notes/cap && for s in hub studio gazebo boardwalk tide channel pier tower bay; do cp $s.png ../sheets/$s-1080p.png; done; cd ../..; rm -rf notes/cap\ncd notes/sheets; magick montage *-1080p.png -tile 3x3 -geometry 640x360+2+2 ../sets-sheet.png 2>/dev/null; cd ../../engine\nfor c in Tree Warrior Lighthouse DeckChair Bridge Seated Squat Tuck Flop Plank Paddle CarryTray; do printf 'animsheet clip=FIT/%s frames=2 size=260 out=../notes/sheets/clip-%s.png\\n' $c $c; done | ./target/debug/pav repl 2>&1 | grep -ci error\ncd ../notes/sheets; magick montage clip-*.png -tile 4x3 -geometry 460x+2+2 ../clips-sheet.png 2>/dev/null; rm -f clip-*.png; ls -la ..","description":"Make the 1080p sheet per set and a motion sheet of the hand-keyed clips","timeout":500000}}}
