{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjdqxsKutV9jhtYkfGjC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**We Stand** is finished: one full run on the final page gives **90 passed, 0 failed**, and the hand-in check passes all 12 items. The page also opens from `file://` at 1920×1080 with no errors, reaching the title and About screens. I didn't look at that last frame by eye; the most recent 1080p image I viewed was from an earlier build.\n\n**Closed since my last message:**\n- **Ghost matching:** \"Ghosts match by area\" now has a direct test, and the browser build uses the same tested function.\n- **Tray Trek pay:** it now pays 200 per glass plus the no-spill bonus, capped at 1000 as every event is.\n- **Feel targets:** the plan's targets are measured and tested. 90% of a full lean takes 0.38 s, overshoot is 4.7%, and settling takes 0.42 s. Idle wander has a mean of 0.046 and a maximum of 0.066.\n- **Event lengths:** these are now tested too. Morning Lap went from about 41 s to 86 s. The Morning Check went from about 47 s to 54 s with the bot; a slower player takes longer, up to about 70 s.\n\n**What's still open:**\n- **Breath Bloom and Tempo Squats scoring:** these still differ from the plan's formulas on purpose. The plan's versions give idle play a star, which breaks its own rule, and the change is noted in `notes/decisions.md`.\n- **The plan audit:** `notes/plan-audit.md` is my own reading. Items the tests and `tests/dev/handin_check.py` don't cover rest on my judgement.\n- **Can't be done on this computer:** a person playing or listening to it, and a real controller, phone, TV or GPU.\n\nThe Source Information and feedback are in my earlier reply, on the About screen and in `exit-interview.json`. The exit interview's issue count of about 20 doesn't include these last timing and pay fixes, which are in `notes/feedback.md`. Build caches are deleted.\n\nEverything is in `work/`; open `WeStand-WiiFit-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261104-223953.html` to play."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":821269,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809},"output_tokens":706,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb437ba7-0477-4143-bb04-ff33f49efd62","uuid":"41fa2902-25b8-4743-965e-c44942bbff72","timestamp":"2026-11-05T10:38:06.807Z","request_id":"req_011CgjdqxTGvnv67f7vev6g3"}
